      "text_html": "<i><b>✨</b></i> <b>Designers × AI<br><br></b><i><b>🆕</b></i> The mockup era is over. Today’s AI tools give <b>every</b> designer a <b>superpower</b>: you can now <b>craft</b> your ideas, not just draw them. <br><br>The gap between “what if…?” and “look, it works!” has never been smaller, and that <b>changed</b> how we build features in Telegram.<br><br><b>Message </b><a href=\"https://t.me/designers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>@designers</b></a><b> to submit your concepts.</b><br><br><i><b>✔️</b></i> <b>We accept</b><br><i>– Working, ready-to-implement code<br></i> complemented by<i><br>– A demo video of your feature in action</i><br><br><i><b>🗑</b></i> <b>We no longer accept</b><br><i>– Static mockups<br>– Demo videos with no code behind them<br>– Text-only concepts</i><br><br>No coding background? Curiosity, attention to detail and a good prompt will take you far. <br><br>The future of design isn’t drawn – it’s built. <br><br><i><b>🚀</b></i> <b>Let's build it together!</b><br><br><i>(An example of what is possible by our iOS designer – this is a ready to use implementation not a motion video.) </i><i><b>👇</b></i>",
